      "prompt": "Draft a task plan for the whole one-screen Feedback Board, split between a backend worker and a frontend worker. Together the tasks must cover every acceptance criterion: FB-01 to FB-08.",
      "allowedRequirementIds": [
        "FB-01",
        "FB-02",
        "FB-03",
        "FB-04",
        "FB-05",
        "FB-06",
        "FB-07",
